{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZtW-WLJJK4bZBsDtVQu4TQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.914694+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZtW-WLJJK4bZBsDtVQu4TQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>中山大学化学工程与技术学院成立于2015年，其前身为创办于1924年的中山大学化学系，是中山大学为大力发展工科，在原化学与化学工程学院化工系基础上建立。学院主责建设“化学工程与工艺”国家一流本科专业点和“化学工程与技术”一级学科博士、硕士学位授权点，支撑建设“材料与化工”博士、硕士专业学位授权点和“资源与环境”博士专业学位授权点。2025年，在籍本科生307人、硕士研究生231人、博士研究生103人，已建立起学位层次类别齐全、学生规模结构合理的“本－硕－博”完整人才培养体系。</span></p><p><span>学院坐落于环境优美的珠海校区“海琴五号”大楼，楼内规划有高规格公共实验测试平台（大型仪器设备超1亿元）、教学和科研实验室等，为学院高质量发展提供了良好的条件保障。学院紧密围绕学校大力发展工科，服务国家区域经济发展及“粤港澳大湾区”建设，近五年，学院教师承担了国家自然科学基金杰出青年基金、重大科学仪器专项、重大研究计划、国家重点研发计划项目、广东省自然科学基金杰出青年基金、国家自然科学基金面上项目、企业合作项目等各类项目360余项，在Angew. Chem. Int. Ed.、PNAS、Chem、Nat. Commun.、Adv. Mater.、JACS等杂志发表了系列高水平论文，授权120多项发明专利，实现2600多万元的成果转化。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/N8jVuzEXodF8zAAWJrajKAsx8xPYvhlhiaS4xfI7zdibQbO98Y7Ria5paDkcoKz5AphibdTfK5Xib14II2Ffz3p67ZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>化学工程与技术学院海琴五号大楼</span></p></section><section><section><p><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，让优秀学子能近距离接触中山大学化学工程与技术学院学术科研环境，培养从事科学研究的兴趣。我院将于2025年7月上旬举办中山大学化学工程与技术学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动，现将有关事宜通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动面向全国高校拟选拔招收营员约50人（最终人数和各专业招收名额根据报名情况适当调整，择优录取）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，学风端正，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2、国内高校的在校全日制三年级（2026年应届毕业生）优秀本科生。</span></p><p><span>3、本科为化学工程与工艺、化学、材料科学与工程、物理、生物、环境等相关专业，学习成绩优秀，具有较强实践能力和较好的科研潜质，本科前两年半学习成绩排名原则上在所读院校同年级本专业前30%之内。</span></p><p><span>4、具有良好听、说、读、写的英语应用能力，通过全国大学英语六级考试者（≥425分）优先。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、《2025年中山大学化学工程与技术学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（附件1），须加盖本科院系公章或教务章；</span></p><p><span>2、本科阶段前三年（或两年半）成绩单与总成绩排名证明（由本科高校教务部门盖章或院系盖章）；</span></p><p><span>3、体现自身英语水平的证明（如四、六级成绩单、TOEFL成绩、IELTS成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩）；</span></p><p><span>4、身份证（将正反面复印在1张A4纸上）及学生证复印件（将个人信息页和注册信息页复印在1张A4纸上）；</span></p><p><span>5、获奖证书复印件（限填5项）；</span></p><p><span>6、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文（其中已发表论文提供论文首页）、专利或其他原创性工作成果等。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、</span><strong><span>在线填写报名问卷</span></strong><span>：即日起至2025年6月25日23:30分，登录</span><strong><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Ok2CAP5.aspx#</span></strong><span>进行网上报名，我院将于6月底或7月初在学院官网（https://cet.sysu.edu.cn/taxonomy/term/150）公布入营名单。</span></p><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>提交电子版材料</span></strong><span>：2025年6月25日24:00前，申请人须将申请材料的扫描件打包发送到邮箱 </span><strong><span>huzhb7@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></strong><span>，附件格式为rar/zip，压缩包内每个文件的命名格式为“姓名_序号_文件名称”，例如：张三_1_活动申请表、张三_2_成绩单、……，压缩包命名格式以及邮件主题均为“本科大学+姓名+2025夏令营报名”，例如，中山大学+张三+2025夏令营报名，不按照格式命名会作为垃圾邮件处理。电子版申请材料将用于资格审查。</span></p><p><span>3、</span><strong><span>提交纸质版材料</span></strong><span>：公布夏令营入营名单后，获得入营资格的申请人须提交纸质版材料：附件1和身份证（将正反面复印在1张A4纸上）及学生证复印件。材料不合格者将取消资格，替补其他申请人。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审查及人员选拔</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、对照申请条件，学院对申请人的材料进行形式审查。</span></p><p><span>2、学院对形式审查合格的申请材料进行综合评议，按照一定比例择优确定夏令营入营名单。</span></p><p><span>3、学院于2025年7月初在学院网站公布夏令营入营名单。</span></p><p><span>4、获得入营资格的申请人须在规定时间内确认参营，逾期未确认视为自动放弃参营资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排及要求</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院将于2025年7月上旬举办中山大学化学工程与技术学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动，期间将通过举行专业介绍、专题讲座、师生联谊交流等多种活动，帮助有志于从事科学研究的学生了解学科发展的前沿，提前感受研究生生活。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动费用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院将为学员提供夏令营期间的住宿费及三餐费用。学员在夏令营期间的交通费等费用自付。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人须对所提交材料的真实性负责，经审核若发现存在材料虚假或材料不合格者，将承担因此产生的一切后果。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section